# 36. WHAT CAN A MITM ATTACKER DO?

Depending on the protocol and environment, an attacker may attempt to:

### Observe

Read unencrypted traffic.

### Modify

Alter unencrypted traffic.

### Redirect

Send users toward another destination.

### Block

Drop packets.

### Inject

Insert traffic into vulnerable/unencrypted communication.

