# 39. MITM AND SESSION COOKIES

If an application transmits session cookies over plaintext HTTP, a network attacker may potentially capture them.

This is one reason secure applications should use:

- HTTPS
- Secure cookies
- Appropriate cookie attributes
- HSTS
- Session protection

